Dialogue: 7,0:02:08.19,0:02:16.62,OP - CN - 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}对不起  让人如此地思念
Dialogue: 7,0:02:16.62,0:02:20.41,OP - CN - 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}究竟是谁的错呢
Dialogue: 7,0:02:20.41,0:02:28.84,OP - CN - 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}无所谓  让人如此地寂寞
Dialogue: 7,0:02:28.84,0:02:32.67,OP - CN - 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}干脆就让它消失吧
Dialogue: 7,0:02:34.09,0:02:35.88,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK_中}Sunday  morning
Dialogue: 7,0:02:35.88,0:02:40.31,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}我比谁都更加爱着你
Dialogue: 7,0:02:40.31,0:02:45.77,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}就连悲伤都可以跨越
Dialogue: 7,0:02:46.35,0:02:48.15,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur10\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK_中\3c&HF0BF3C&}Sunday  morning
Dialogue: 6,0:02:48.15,0:02:49.57,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\3c&HEFA5AA&}无论何时  比谁都想要抱紧你
Dialogue: 6,0:02:49.57,0:02:51.07,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\3c&H8184F5&}无论何时  比谁都想要抱紧你
Dialogue: 6,0:02:51.07,0:02:52.40,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\3c&H4DD5B0&}无论何时  比谁都想要抱紧你
Dialogue: 7,0:02:52.40,0:02:54.86,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}我逐渐地坠入
Dialogue: 7,0:02:54.86,0:02:58.74,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}无法自救的爱河
Dialogue: 7,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.74,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}{\t(0,600,\bord8\c&H080303&\3c&H40E8FC&)}虽然可能有点啰嗦  但我已经爱上你了
Dialogue: 7,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.79,OP - CN - 3,,0,0,13,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}我犯了爱上你的罪  想和你一起生活下去
